          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your ability to move unseen is startling for one your size, causing panic among your enemies. When you successfully @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Hide] when previously observed, creatures you are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Hidden] from become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 1}. They are then temporarily immune to Alarming Disappearance for 1 hour. Typically, creatures that have traveled with you for a significant time, such as your fellow party members, are immune to your Alarming Disappearance.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 5
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": [
              {
                "value": "expert in Stealth"
              }
            ]
          },
